es his people, he has made you king over them.”","source":"web"},{"ref":"Psalm 109:4","note":"In return for my love, they are my adversaries; but I am in prayer.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Proverbs 5:19","note":"A loving doe and a graceful deer— let her breasts satisfy you at all times. Be captivated always with her love.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}